  "title": "RYANAIR ANNOUNCES PLANS FOR MAJOR SHANNON EXPANSION",
  "summary": "€50M INVESTMENT IN NEW 4-BAY AIRCRAFT MAINTENANCE HANGAR & ENGINEERING ACADEMY CREATES OVER 400 HIGH SKILLED JOBS Ryanair, Europe’s No.1 low fares airline, today (23 July) announced that it has submitted a planning application for a major expansion of its engineering operations at Shannon Airport, to become Ryanair’s largest aircraft maintenance facility in Ireland. This €50m investment will include a new 4-bay aircraft Maintenance, Repair and Overhaul (MRO) hangar at Shannon Airport, further strengthening Ryanair’s […]",
